---
layout: base
permalink: /submit-news/
title: Submit a Story
description: "Send a cybersecurity, IT, MSP, privacy, vulnerability, tool, or research link for possible inclusion in The Defender’s Dispatch."
---

<article
  class="newsletter-page submission-page"
  data-news-submission
  {% if newsletter.configured %}
  data-newsletter-api-url="{{ newsletter.apiUrl }}"
  {% endif %}
>
  <header class="newsletter-hero submission-hero">
    <p class="newsletter-kicker">Community Signal</p>
    <h1>Send me a signal</h1>
    <p class="newsletter-hero__lede">
      Found reporting, research, an advisory, or a practical tool that deserves more attention?
    </p>
    <p>
      Share the original link and tell me why it matters. I review submissions for possible inclusion in The Defender’s Dispatch, but submitting something does not guarantee publication.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="submission-layout">
    <section class="submission-form-card" aria-labelledby="submission-form-heading">
      <p class="newsletter-signup-card__eyebrow">Reader submission</p>
      <h2 id="submission-form-heading">What did you find?</h2>

      {% if newsletter.configured %}
      <form class="newsletter-form submission-form" data-news-submission-form novalidate>
        <div class="newsletter-field">
          <label for="submission-headline">Article headline</label>
          <input
            id="submission-headline"
            name="headline"
            type="text"
            maxlength="180"
            required
          />
        </div>

        <div class="newsletter-field">
          <label for="submission-url">Original article URL</label>
          <input
            id="submission-url"
            name="article_url"
            type="url"
            inputmode="url"
            placeholder="https://"
            maxlength="2048"
            required
          />
        </div>

        <div class="newsletter-field">
          <label for="submission-source">Source or publication <span>(optional)</span></label>
          <input
            id="submission-source"
            name="source"
            type="text"
            maxlength="120"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="newsletter-field">
          <label for="submission-category">Category</label>
          <select id="submission-category" name="category" required>
            <option value="">Choose a category</option>
            <option value="cybersecurity">Cybersecurity</option>
            <option value="vulnerabilities">Vulnerabilities and exploits</option>
            <option value="privacy">Privacy</option>
            <option value="identity">Identity and access</option>
            <option value="cloud">Cloud security</option>
            <option value="it-operations">IT operations</option>
            <option value="msp">MSP</option>
            <option value="ai">AI and security</option>
            <option value="tools-research">Tools and research</option>
            <option value="other">Other</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="newsletter-field">
          <label for="submission-why">Why does this deserve attention?</label>
          <textarea
            id="submission-why"
            name="why_it_matters"
            rows="6"
            maxlength="1200"
            aria-describedby="submission-why-help"
            required
          ></textarea>
          <small id="submission-why-help">Focus on the defender, administrator, or MSP takeaway—not only the headline.</small>
        </div>

        <fieldset class="submission-fieldset">
          <legend>About you</legend>

          <div class="newsletter-field">
            <label for="submission-name">Name or online handle <span>(optional for anonymous submissions)</span></label>
            <input
              id="submission-name"
              name="submitter_name"
              type="text"
              autocomplete="name"
              maxlength="100"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="newsletter-field">
            <label for="submission-email">Email address</label>
            <input
              id="submission-email"
              name="email"
              type="email"
              autocomplete="email"
              inputmode="email"
              maxlength="254"
              required
            />
          </div>

          <div class="newsletter-field">
            <label for="submission-credit">How should I credit you?</label>
            <select id="submission-credit" name="credit_preference" required>
              <option value="">Choose a credit preference</option>
              <option value="name">Credit my name</option>
              <option value="handle">Credit my online handle</option>
              <option value="anonymous">Keep my submission anonymous</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="submission-fieldset">
          <legend>Relationship and disclosure</legend>

          <div class="newsletter-field">
            <label for="submission-relationship">What is your relationship to this material?</label>
            <select id="submission-relationship" name="relationship" required>
              <option value="">Choose one</option>
              <option value="none">No relationship</option>
              <option value="author">I am the author or a contributor</option>
              <option value="employer">My employer is involved</option>
              <option value="vendor">I represent the vendor or organization</option>
              <option value="client">A client or customer is involved</option>
              <option value="other">Other relationship</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="newsletter-field">
            <label for="submission-disclosure">Disclosure or additional context <span>(required when a relationship exists)</span></label>
            <textarea
              id="submission-disclosure"
              name="disclosure"
              rows="4"
              maxlength="600"
            ></textarea>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="newsletter-honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
          <label for="submission-website">Leave this field blank</label>
          <input
            id="submission-website"
            name="website"
            type="text"
            tabindex="-1"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>

        <label class="newsletter-consent">
          <input name="consent" type="checkbox" required />
          <span>I understand that submission does not guarantee inclusion and that my email will only be used to acknowledge or follow up on this submission.</span>
        </label>

        <div
          class="cf-turnstile"
          data-sitekey="{{ newsletter.turnstileSiteKey }}"
          data-theme="auto"
          data-action="reader-submission"
        ></div>

        <button class="newsletter-submit" type="submit" data-news-submission-submit>
          <span data-news-submission-submit-label>Send this signal</span>
        </button>

        <p class="newsletter-form__status" data-news-submission-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
      {% else %}
      <div class="newsletter-setup-note" role="status">
        <strong>Reader submissions are almost ready.</strong>
        <span>The submission service is being connected. Check back shortly.</span>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </section>

    <aside class="submission-guidelines" aria-labelledby="submission-guidelines-heading">
      <p class="newsletter-kicker">Before you send it</p>
      <h2 id="submission-guidelines-heading">A useful signal has context</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Link to the original reporting, advisory, research, or project whenever possible.</li>
        <li>Explain what defenders, administrators, or MSPs should notice.</li>
        <li>Disclose whether you, your employer, a client, or a vendor is involved.</li>
        <li>Do not send shortened links, files, press-release attachments, or confidential information.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        This form does not subscribe you to The Defender’s Dispatch. Newsletter signup remains a separate, explicit choice.
      </p>
      <a class="newsletter-secondary-link" href="/newsletter/">About The Defender’s Dispatch</a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</article>

{% if newsletter.configured %}
<script src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js" async defer></script>
<script src="/assets/scripts/components/news-submission.min.js" defer></script>
{% endif %}
